# Flat-color placeholder material for the STEP2 Key pickup.
# No map_Kd line on purpose: modelRenderer.cpp leaves TextureName empty when
# map_Kd is absent, LoadFromWICFile then fails harmlessly on that empty path,
# Texture stays null, and unlitTexturePS.hlsl falls back to Material.Diffuse
# (i.e. Kd below) -- a flat-colored cube with no image asset required.
newmtl Solid
Ns 96.000000
Ka 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
Kd 0.850000 0.650000 0.150000
Ks 0.400000 0.400000 0.400000
Ke 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000
Ni 1.450000
d 1.000000
illum 2
